/// extends CallbackSystemEvent` (`App/Callback/Events/InkWidgetSpawnEvent.hpp`), MESMA receita
/// robusta já provada 3x (`GameSessionEvent`/`AxisInputEvent`/`VehicleLightControlEvent`): campos
